text = "WASD  move          Mouse  look
Shift  swap stance    Space  hold to charge leap
Space (past apex)  ear-parasail
Ctrl  footdrum        F  tail twist
E  spit a seed (costs one, bursts pods)
Right mouse  hold to aim    Q  lock target
R  respawn            Esc  free mouse"
